Package: pons
Title: Interface to Microsoft Office for the 'DescToolsX' Ecosystem
Version: 0.0.0.925
Authors@R: c(
  person(given="Andri", family="Signorell", 
         email = "andri@signorell.net", 
         role = c("aut", "cre"),
         comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4311-1969"))
 )
Description: Connects R to Microsoft Word and Excel on Windows through
    the Component Object Model. Content of most common R classes can be
    written into a running Word document, bookmarks can be created,
    renamed, located and refilled, and whole reports can therefore be
    updated in place rather than rebuilt. On the Excel side, the
    selected range - including disjoint multi-area selections - is read
    back into a data frame, matrix, list or table, either directly or
    through an interactive dialog, and R objects can be sent the other
    way for inspection in a spreadsheet. The package supplies the Office
    interface used by the DescToolsX ecosystem.
